  "notes": [
    "Plant wind case P08_reeds (Reeds) written by scripts/build_plants.py: Two 30093 sea-grass reeds in cones, each with a 30239 swordleaf clipped on its top bar. Parts picked by constant name from data/categories/parts; frame LDU, -Y up, the case front faces -Z, ground (base top) at y = 0. The wind blows toward +X.",
